# Release metadata; the version DOI is added after Zenodo archives the tag.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the preferred-citation
  information.

type: dataset
title: Grandes incendios forestales en España
abstract: >-
  Collection of 329 selected EGIF forest-fire reports from 2010–2023 and
  a reconciled view of 455 fire records from 2010–2026. EGIF takes priority
  where a documented correspondence exists; official MITECO reports and
  provisional bulletins provide fallback data. Available as CSV, JSON and
  GeoJSON with stable fire and report identifiers, forest areas, provenance,
  notes and EPSG:4326 coordinates where interpretable. Nine legacy identities
  and eight selected reports remain unmatched. The collection does not provide
  complete annual coverage or a definitive national fire count. Data reuse
  follows the MITECO legal notice. Code and documentation use the MIT license.
  Derived municipal geography: CartoBase ANE 2006–2024, CC BY 4.0, ign.es.
  Bundled third-party assets retain their own notices.

